.Dd February 11, 2026
.Dt VOP_POLL 9
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm vop_poll
.Nd query poll/select readiness for a vnode
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In sys/param.h
.In sys/poll.h
.In vfs/vnode.h
.Ft int
.Fn vop_poll "struct vnode *vp" "int events" "struct ucred *cred"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn vop_poll
returns readiness events for select/poll users.
If the filesystem provides a poll callback, it is used.
Otherwise, the wrapper returns a conservative mask containing only supported
poll bits requested by the caller.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns a bitmask of ready poll events.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr vnode 9 ,
.Xr vop_ioctl 9
